  "description": "Operating Area: Indonesia\n\nSamara II is a traditional phinisi boat with a modern interpretation. The stylish interiors of the boat have been designed to draw in more natural light, bringing out a fresh, bright, and relaxing ambiance throughout the boat. One of the special features is the sundeck, which is perfect for sunbathing and relaxing out in the sun. The shaded foredeck offers a seating area as well as an outdoor gathering spot. Samara II can accommodate up to 8 guests, with 4 cabins and 2 shared bathrooms with toilet and shower. It is perfect for a small family, romantic cruise and honeymoon.\n",
